  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Pick a post",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Markers</strong>, tap <strong>Friendly</strong>, <strong>Position</strong> and the symbol tile in the middle of the popup. Pick a post, such as <strong>Observation post</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/24e529059191b6ae.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check its sight",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Sight</strong> shows what the post can see up to 2 km. Tap <strong>Place</strong>, then the map.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/de12c740dddbcb13.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See what it sees",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Green shows the ground the post can see, red the ground it cannot. <strong>Hide sight</strong> clears it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e25ffbbbf3db7d99.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mark a code-name point",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For a place you call by its code name, pick <strong>Code-name point</strong> under <strong>Friendly</strong> and <strong>Position</strong>. Type the code name, then tap <strong>Place</strong> and the map.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/224ebbe0aa893af8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Draw a patrol's route",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For a patrol, pick <strong>Patrol line</strong> under <strong>Friendly</strong> and <strong>Position</strong>. Tap <strong>Colour</strong> to tell it from other patrols.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/10f66f3673fea1bf.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a patrol's colour",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a colour, then <strong>Place</strong>. Tap the line's corners on the map and <strong>Done</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/39f298d0c5e62dd7.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Each mark shows on the map with its short name, such as <strong>OP</strong>. A point reads <strong>NOT SENT</strong> until you send it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a8c505f829a8819e.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
